MODEL_FEEDBACK_JSON:
{
  "positive_alignment_reasons": [
    "A Pentatonix Christmas felt like the strongest match because it combines the Christmas repertoire I have repeatedly chosen with the vocal-group sound I associate with The New Old Fashioned.",
    "That's Christmas To Me and The Andy Williams Christmas Album felt relevant because they continue my clear interest in Christmas music. Passing on them today does not mean I dislike that direction."
  ],
  "negative_misalignment_reasons": [
    "Adele's albums and Frozen Soundtrack did not give me the same connection to holiday vocal music; being music I might recognize is not enough to make me choose it now.",
    "The Ultimate Collection, The Very Best Of, and Partners gave me too little evidence of a musical connection to my interests, so I would not spend one of my occasional selections on them."
  ],
  "overgeneralized_signals": [
    "Some choices seemed to treat an interest in vocal music as a reason to recommend general pop albums, while the holiday repertoire matters much more to me here.",
    "Christmas themes alone explain some of the appeal, but they do not fully explain why I preferred a vocal-group holiday album over another classic Christmas recording."
  ],
  "missing_or_underweighted_signals": [
    "The combination of my repeated Christmas listening and my latest choice, The New Old Fashioned, matters more than either interest by itself.",
    "I rarely choose something unless the connection is strong, and I only wanted one album today; several relevant albums can appeal to me without prompting additional choices."
  ],
  "summary_diagnosis": "The recommendations understood my Christmas interest, but only some captured the holiday and vocal-group combination that made me want to choose an album today."
}
